  "target_process_note": "The composition layer's target process is Zielinski et al. (2019), E. coli 20 IBA 1 / pIBAINS in GMS medium, 4 L in a 7.5 L Bioflo Celligen 310 with pH-stat glucose feeding at 30 degC. Simensen et al. measure a wild-type MG1655 in M9 with 2% glucose, 1 L in a 3 L BioFlo 115, in batch exponential growth at 37 degC, and state that biomass composition is condition-dependent. This dataset is that measurement; it is not transferred to the insulin process.",
